{
  "bookId": "hero-212110",
  "id": "bond-41101",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41101001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哟，我回来了。真是热血的一天啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "41101003",
              "text": "欢迎回来，恭介！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "41101003",
              "text": "太好了，恭介平安回来了！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "41101002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "怎么一脸「勇者居然无伤归来，真是太好了」的表情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为大家都说看到你在和巨兽搏斗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "手臂也被巨兽吃了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "「巨兽」？啊，是说粮丸吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "果然是它啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "不过不必担心，粮丸现在已经是「little busters」的荣誉队员了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哼哼，别看它那样，其实也是心怀青春热血之人，不对，之猫啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "明，明明听说只是在打架……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "「战斗可是灵魂级别的对话」，我昨天读的漫画里有这样一句名言。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "勇者和拳击手经过激烈的战斗后成为了同伴……简直感动到落泪！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来如此。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "（——所以今天才去挑战猫猫拳了吗？）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "不过还是希望粮丸不要再含着我的手臂了，全是口水……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "好了，不管那些小事，该给新成员定个称号了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "「吞噬宇宙的幻兽」，怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41101019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不知为什么，感觉超级合适……不愧是恭介。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
